   3250  fbfc							; like the tail pads below. A bank0 caller runs `sta $1FFx` AT A; the next
   3251  fbfc							; opcode fetch (A+3) already comes from the TARGET bank, which keeps only the
   3252  fbfc							; `jmp` half. Nothing in bank1/bank2/bank3 calls a CallPad (only `jmp
